# Saga of the Phoenix Knight (Q070), the first saga on the saga core, played by a level 76
# Paladin from the start: Sedrick offers it and gives the main item; Felix sends the player to
# Donath, who asks for an Ice Crystal and a fish the player does not hold; the main NPC has
# nothing more to say until the tablets are done. Expectations of the traced steps are the reference trace's; the rest are derived from the
# reference source (ThirdClassQuest.java, Q070_SagaOfThePhoenixKnight.java).
